  "details": "as you know watching youtube videos in vrchat is half baked and a lot of people eventually run into the issue of youtube videos not loading at all. I would love to see the ability to directly sign into your youtube/google account directly through video players in vrchat or through another means within vrchat itself giving native support for youtube videos. furthermore it is incredibly frustrating how irritating it is to not have a video work because youtube decides you're a robot or because you cant sign into your youtube account, thus not allowing you to watch 18+ videos. some videos have adult themes or language etc in them and its annoying as hell as someone with a 11 year old google account who actively pays for youtube premium and regularly engages in watch sessions through vrchat with my friends to have this many issues with videos not playing.",
